While wearing a god cape, [[Charge]] boosts the damage of the corresponding god spell by 50% for seven minutes (with a boosted maximum hit of 30).

==Imbuing==
Players with level 75 in Magic can imbue a god cape by taking a [[Justiciar's hand]], [[Ent's roots]], and a [[Demon's heart]] to Kolodion during [[Mage Arena II]] miniquest. After the quest, subsequent imbues will require only the respective component of the god cape that they wish to imbue. Alternatively, players can purchase any one of the three capes from [[Perdu]] for {{coins|250,000}}.

The imbued ancient cape is created by combining any other imbued god cape with the [[ancient fabric]], which is awarded for completing [[Pete Kayer]]'s final challenge.
