Imbued capes have +5 magic attack, +5 magic defence, and +2% magic strength bonuses when compared to their non-imbued versions, as well as different cosmetic appearances.

After giving the [[Armageddon cape fabric]] to [[Nigel]], imbued god caps can be used on him to make the [[Imbued Saradomin cape (Deadman)]], [[Imbued Zamorak cape (Deadman)]], [[Imbued Guthix cape (Deadman)]], or [[Imbued ancient cape (Deadman)]].

A [[max cape]] can be combined with an imbued god cape to make the [[imbued Saradomin max cape]], [[imbued Zamorak max cape]], [[imbued Guthix max cape]], or [[imbued ancient max cape]] respectively.
